{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"印度尼西亚","country_iso":"IDN","created_at":"2026-03-23T10:15:50.517996","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"IDN-HB-0026","ldc":"No","location":"马鲁古省","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"印度尼西亚马鲁古省塞兰岛养殖场微网储能EPC项目","project_name_en":"Indonesia Maluku Province Seram Island Farm Microgrid Energy Storage EPC Project","subcategory":"光储"},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"中机国际","content":"近日，中机国际成功中标印尼哇哈拿有限公司印尼养殖场微网储能EPC项目。中机国际以持续的技术研发和项目管理能力，助推能源的清洁利用与转型升级，擦亮新型工业化绿色底色。\n该项目位于印度尼西亚马鲁古省塞兰岛，占地面积95亩，光伏装机容量为8.00632MWp，储能系为6.9MW/13.76MWh，通过1回20KV集电线路接入养殖场内原有的20KV配电系统，实现与电网的互联互通。项目的建设将显著降低养殖场的运营成本,同时提升用能的清洁性和可靠性。通过技术创新和模式创新，项目将推动新型电力系统、“微网+储能”融合发展的进程，为全球清洁能源发展贡献智慧和力量。\n近年来，中机国际紧抓双碳发展机遇，不断探索和实践，持续拓展新业务领域，为推动产业结构高端化、能源消费低碳化、资源利用循环化，实现绿色高质量发展助力赋能。","content_sha256":"e65468899b818b4d4b9d4dd1bb8f7fcb279e9ab79ae295e497f43f39e30e3ba6","id":7517,"publish_date":"2024-07-24 17:36:28","title":"中机国际中标印尼微网储能EPC项目","title_sha256":"6a6df334ce00f9512195a5725c013939e88dc6ead6a664016be13e5623e82ed6","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/68861.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"IDN-HB-0026","capacity_details":"PV: 8.00632MW, BESS: 6.9MW","capacity_mw":14.90632,"capacity_mw_raw":"14.90632","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T10:15:50.518384","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"IDN-HB-0026-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"http://www.ciodpa.org.cn/index.php?m=content&c=index&a=show&catid=80&id=17618\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"印尼哇哈拿有限公司","project_devel